    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "資料來源：1.中華民國資料來自「中油公司網站」每月最後一週日公告之稅後零售價。"
    },
    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "                     2.韓國資料來自Korea Energy Statistics Information System (KESIS)按月出版「Monthly Energy Statistics」之加油站月平均零售價，資料遞延2個月。"
    },
    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "                     3.日本資料來自経済産業省 資源エネルギー庁，「石油製品価格調査」每月最後一週公告之稅後零售價。"
    },
    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "                     4.新加坡資料來自「新加坡統計部查詢系統(https://tablebuilder.singstat.gov.sg/table/TS/M212891)」公告之月平均零售價。"
    },
    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "Source: 1. R.O.C: Post-tax retail prices are sourced from the monthly announcement of CPC Corporation on the last Sunday of each month."
    },
    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "                2. Korea: Monthly average retail prices are sourced from the \"Monthly Energy Statistics\" published by the Korea Energy Statistics Information System (KESIS), and there is a two-month data lag."
    },
    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "                3. Japan: Post-tax retail prices are sourced from the \"Petroleum Product Price Survey\" announced by the Agency for Natural Resources and Energy, Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry at the end of each month."
    },
    {
      "9-04亞鄰國家油品價格_Petroleum Sales Prices in Asian Countries": "                4. Singapore: Monthly average retail prices are sourced from the Singapore Department of Statistics Inquiry System (https://tablebuilder.singstat.gov.sg/table/TS/M212891)."
    }
